Package: koncepcja
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Amstrad CPC emulator with a debugger and an IPC control port
 konCePCja emulates the Amstrad CPC 464, 664, 6128 and the 6128+ at the
 chip level: Z80, Gate Array, CRTC 6845 (types 0-3), PPI, AY-3-8912, uPD765
 floppy controller with flux-level disk images, tape deck, and the Plus
 ASIC, plus expansions such as the M4 board, Symbiface II, AMX mouse,
 Multiface II, light guns and an HP-GL plotter.
 .
 It ships a Dear ImGui interface with DevTools (disassembler, memory,
 breakpoints, watchpoints, an assembler), a TCP control port for scripting
 and automated testing, and a telnet console mirroring the CPC's text
 output.
 .
 The vendored SDL3 the binary is built against is installed privately under
 /usr/lib/koncepcja.
